              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na andũ ma Mbethi‐semesi makũlya, Nũũ ũla ũtonya kũũngama mbee wa Yeova, Ngai ũũ mũtheu? Na akambata kwaũ aume kwitũ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na matũma atũmwa kwa ala matwĩe Kiliathi‐yealimu, makyasya, Avilisiti nĩmatũngĩte ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova; theeai, na mũkĩyambatya kwenyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
